其中，关键字 “</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">privileges</span>” 可以省略。</pre><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;\">10.grant 高级 test1管理 MySQL 中所有数据库的权限</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;\"><br></span></b></p><pre style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">grant</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">all</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">on</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">*</span>.<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">*</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); line-height: 1.5 !important;\">to</span> test1@\'localhost\'</pre><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><b>11.grant作用在整个服务器上：</b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot; !important;\"><br></p><pre style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-